<title>USA: Bradley Real Estate Inc Q1 FFO shr up.</title>
<headline>Bradley Real Estate Inc Q1 FFO shr up.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> FFO Shr		    $0.44		    $0.33</p>
<p> Funds from oper	  9,557		    4,083</p>
<p> Revs			23,181		   11,321</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,666		   12,537</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net income $8,924,000 or $0.41 a share vs $11,375,000 or $0.91 a share. Q1 1997 net income included gains on sale of properties of $3.1 million or $0.14 a share. Q1 1996 net income included gains on sale of properties of $9.4 million or $0.75 a share.</p>
<p>Excluding gains, Q1 1997 net income was $5.9 million or $0.27 a share vs $2.0 million or $0.16 a share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
